<p>I liked it, but&#8230;</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Proposal:</strong> Use of SCP-█████<br />
<strong>O5 Approval:</strong> Approved<br />
<strong>Result:</strong> [DATA EXPUNGED]<br />
<strong>Notes:</strong> <em>SCP-███ has been reclassified as Euclid. -Dr Klaus</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p>Inconsistent SCP designation. At the bottom you have 3 digits blacked out, but above you have not 4, but <em>5</em> black boxes. Also, I'm not entirely opposed to the idea of using an SCP on this, but the way it's executed here just doesn't add anything.</p>

